  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Installation and Training Laboratory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to establish laboratory facilities at the University of Mitrovica. These facilities will be equipped to train students in (waste)water analyses and tests related to the operation of wastewater treatment plants. Manuals and test programmes will also be provided. The facilities are essential for developing and implementing a curriculum for wastewater treatment at the University of Mitrovica, Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
